        "created_at": "2013-02-14T15:11:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You were looking for a ruling on the duplicate powers issue, right?&nbsp; (Not the original villain character card discussion).</p><p>The post I linked to is from one of the creators saying first that having two copies of the same power does not make one power use doubly effective.&nbsp; Then he says that if you can use multiple powers, you can use each instance of the same power.&nbsp; Is there some other element of this you wanted clarification on?</p>",
